re flexible army building. Combined with three hero classes — Warrior, Paladin, or Mage — this creates a wide range of viable playstyles and strong replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its larger scope, new threats, and expanded mechanics, <strong>King’s Bounty: Armored Princess</strong> offers a deeper and more demanding experience that rewards curiosity, planning, and tactical thinking over dozens of hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170/extras/d299712c36a5d09f7ee3db0924ae466c.poster.avif?t=1786626361\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170/extras/d299712c36a5d09f7ee3db0924ae466c.webm?t=1786626361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170/extras/d299712c36a5d09f7ee3db0924ae466c.mp4?t=1786626361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time exploration meets deep turn-based tactical battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in real time, then switch to carefully paced, turn-based combat where positioning, morale, unit abilities, and preparation decide the outcome..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A huge hand-crafted world with dozens of locations and battlefields</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across towns, wild landscapes, remote islands, and dangerous dungeons, fighting battles both on the surface and deep underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New enemies, powerful bosses, and a new race</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face huge monstrous bosses, deadly creatures, and an entirely new enemy faction — the bloodthirsty Lizards — each bringing new tactical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Princess Amelie — New protagonist with new abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and characteristics that change how you explore the world and approach encounters, including the ability to fly and reach otherwise inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A pet dragon that grows into a devastating ally</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small, amusing companion and watch it evolve into a powerful force, unlocking abilities such as treasure hunting, direct attacks, battle rage, and even summoning volcanic eruptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded strategic systems and army building</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions, experiment with new unit combinations, and build armies around morale bonuses, abilities, and tactical synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three hero classes with different playstyles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Warrior, Paladin, or Mage, each offering distinct strengths and approaches to combat and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic world that raises the stakes as you progress</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger enemies, greater risks, and better rewards push you to adapt your strategy and plan every step carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "King’s Bounty: Armored Princess builds on the foundation of The Legend, expanding the classic formula with deeper turn-based tactics, a huge hand-crafted world, and new mechanics that change how you approach battles and progression.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170/62f947b3451b3f5dfb0fd5410408a4fee5036dff/header.jpg?t=1786626361", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170/3743302f7350d1fc53f377a6cf6fe7d1b59b7849/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786626361", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170/3743302f7350d1fc53f377a6cf6fe7d1b59b7849/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786626361", "website": "http://www.kingsbountygame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6GHz<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1GB<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce 6600 with 128 MB or equivalent ATI<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 5.5 GB of free space<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX-compatible soundcard<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce 7950GT with 512 MB or equivalent ATI<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 5.5 GB of free space<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX-compatible soundcard<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.6 or higher<br>         